    step a step has ended at the time
    and step the step meets "not (if it is a ConformanceResult then it shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax))" at the time.

the trace meets "every step if it is a ConformanceResult then it shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax)" at a time if
    it is not the case that the trace meets "some step: not (if it is a ConformanceResult then it shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax))" at the time.

step a step meets "if it is a CoSimulationResult then it shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax)" at a time if
    it is not the case that step the step was a CoSimulationResult at the time.

step a step meets "shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax) (4)" at a time if
    step the step has shown "produced_by(imandrax)" at the time.

step a step meets "shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax) (4)" at a time if
    step the step has shown "oracle_type(imandrax)" at the time.

step a step meets "if it is a CoSimulationResult then it shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax)" at a time if
    step the step meets "shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax) (4)" at the time.

step a step meets "not (if it is a CoSimulationResult then it shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax))" at a time if
    it is not the case that step the step meets "if it is a CoSimulationResult then it shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax)" at the time.

the trace meets "some step: not (if it is a CoSimulationResult then it shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax))" at a time if
    step a step has ended at the time
    and step the step meets "not (if it is a CoSimulationResult then it shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax))" at the time.

the trace meets "every step if it is a CoSimulationResult then it shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax)" at a time if
    it is not the case that the trace meets "some step: not (if it is a CoSimulationResult then it shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax))" at the time.

the trace meets "the trace: it and every later step if it is a CertificationCase then it an earlier step in its chain is a RegionDecomposition and shows ipl model valid and it and every later step if it is a VerificationResult then it shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax) and it and every later step if it is a StateSpaceAnalysisResult then it shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax) and it and every later step if it is a ConformanceResult then it shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax) and it and every later step if it is a CoSimulationResult then it shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax)" at a time if
    the trace meets "every step if it is a CertificationCase then it an earlier step in its chain is a RegionDecomposition and shows ipl model valid" at the time
    and the trace meets "every step if it is a VerificationResult then it shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax)" at the time
    and the trace meets "every step if it is a StateSpaceAnalysisResult then it shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax)" at the time
    and the trace meets "every step if it is a ConformanceResult then it shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax)" at the time
    and the trace meets "every step if it is a CoSimulationResult then it shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax)" at the time.

when the session ends
    and it is not the case that the trace meets "the trace: it and every later step if it is a CertificationCase then it an earlier step in its chain is a RegionDecomposition and shows ipl model valid and it and every later step if it is a VerificationResult then it shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax) and it and every later step if it is a StateSpaceAnalysisResult then it shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax) and it and every later step if it is a ConformanceResult then it shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax) and it and every later step if it is a CoSimulationResult then it shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax)"
then the policy ipl_cert_cases_from_decomposition is broken.

% ipl_cert_cases_selected (error): (G(CertificationSignoff → P(case_selection_justified ∧ required_classes_covered))) ∧ G(VerificationResult → (produced_by(imandrax) ∨ oracle_type(imandrax))) ∧ G(StateSpaceAnalysisResult → (produced_by(imandrax) ∨ oracle_type(imandrax))) ∧ G(ConformanceResult → (produced_by(imandrax) ∨ oracle_type(imandrax))) ∧ G(CoSimulationResult → (produced_by(imandrax) ∨ oracle_type(imandrax)))
% Case Generation & Selection. ImandraX decomposition is exhaustive by construction, so the full set of regions is typically far too large to run. The certification value comes from a principled selection — representative across behaviour classes, weighted to risk, and always including the invalid and boundary regions — recorded so the choice can be reviewed. Running every case is infeasible; running an arbitrary handful is not certification.
step a step meets "if it is a CertificationSignoff then it an earlier step shows case selection justified and shows required classes covered" at a time if
    it is not the case that step the step was a CertificationSignoff at the time.

step a step meets "an earlier step shows case selection justified and shows required classes covered" at a time if
    step a second step has ended at the time
    and the second step < the step
    and step the second step has shown "case selection justified" at the time
    and step the second step has shown "required classes covered" at the time.

step a step meets "if it is a CertificationSignoff then it an earlier step shows case selection justified and shows required classes covered" at a time if
    step the step meets "an earlier step shows case selection justified and shows required classes covered" at the time.

step a step meets "not (if it is a CertificationSignoff then it an earlier step shows case selection justified and shows required classes covered)" at a time if
    it is not the case that step the step meets "if it is a CertificationSignoff then it an earlier step shows case selection justified and shows required classes covered" at the time.

the trace meets "some step: not (if it is a CertificationSignoff then it an earlier step shows case selection justified and shows required classes covered)" at a time if
    step a step has ended at the time
    and step the step meets "not (if it is a CertificationSignoff then it an earlier step shows case selection justified and shows required classes covered)" at the time.

the trace meets "every step if it is a CertificationSignoff then it an earlier step shows case selection justified and shows required classes covered" at a time if
    it is not the case that the trace meets "some step: not (if it is a CertificationSignoff then it an earlier step shows case selection justified and shows required classes covered)" at the time.

step a step meets "if it is a VerificationResult then it shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax) (2)" at a time if
    it is not the case that step the step was a VerificationResult at the time.

step a step meets "shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax) (5)" at a time if
    step the step has shown "produced_by(imandrax)" at the time.

step a step meets "shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax) (5)" at a time if
    step the step has shown "oracle_type(imandrax)" at the time.

step a step meets "if it is a VerificationResult then it shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax) (2)" at a time if
    step the step meets "shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax) (5)" at the time.

step a step meets "not (if it is a VerificationResult then it shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax)) (2)" at a time if
    it is not the case that step the step meets "if it is a VerificationResult then it shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax) (2)" at the time.

the trace meets "some step: not (if it is a VerificationResult then it shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax)) (2)" at a time if
    step a step has ended at the time
    and step the step meets "not (if it is a VerificationResult then it shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax)) (2)" at the time.

the trace meets "every step if it is a VerificationResult then it shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax) (2)" at a time if
    it is not the case that the trace meets "some step: not (if it is a VerificationResult then it shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax)) (2)" at the time.

step a step meets "if it is a StateSpaceAnalysisResult then it shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax) (2)" at a time if
    it is not the case that step the step was a StateSpaceAnalysisResult at the time.

step a step meets "shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax) (6)" at a time if
    step the step has shown "produced_by(imandrax)" at the time.

