step a step meets "if it is a CoSimulationResult then it shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax) (2)" at a time if
    it is not the case that step the step was a CoSimulationResult at the time.

step a step meets "shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax) (8)" at a time if
    step the step has shown "produced_by(imandrax)" at the time.

step a step meets "shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax) (8)" at a time if
    step the step has shown "oracle_type(imandrax)" at the time.

step a step meets "if it is a CoSimulationResult then it shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax) (2)" at a time if
    step the step meets "shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax) (8)" at the time.

