the trace meets "some step: not (if it is a CoSimulationResult then it shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax)) (2)" at a time if
    step a step has ended at the time
    and step the step meets "not (if it is a CoSimulationResult then it shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax)) (2)" at the time.

the trace meets "every step if it is a CoSimulationResult then it shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax) (2)" at a time if
    it is not the case that the trace meets "some step: not (if it is a CoSimulationResult then it shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax)) (2)" at the time.

the trace meets "the trace: it and every later step if it is a CertificationSignoff then it an earlier step shows case selection justified and shows required classes covered and it and every later step if it is a VerificationResult then it shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax) and it and every later step if it is a StateSpaceAnalysisResult then it shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax) and it and every later step if it is a ConformanceResult then it shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax) and it and every later step if it is a CoSimulationResult then it shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax)" at a time if
    the trace meets "every step if it is a CertificationSignoff then it an earlier step shows case selection justified and shows required classes covered" at the time
    and the trace meets "every step if it is a VerificationResult then it shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax) (2)" at the time
    and the trace meets "every step if it is a StateSpaceAnalysisResult then it shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax) (2)" at the time
    and the trace meets "every step if it is a ConformanceResult then it shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax) (2)" at the time
    and the trace meets "every step if it is a CoSimulationResult then it shows produced_by(imandrax) or shows oracle_type(imandrax) (2)" at the time.

when the session ends
